= INTRODUCTION <ch_introduction>

The internship program is a cornerstone of the bachelor's curriculum at the
*Institute of Digital Technology (IDT)*, *Cambodia Academy of Digital Technology
*. Designed to bridge the gap between academic learning and professional
practice, the program places students within real organizations where they can
contribute to and learn from active projects in their field of study. This
report documents the work undertaken, the challenges encountered, and the
knowledge gained throughout the entirety of my first internship period.

